  "bio": "Valentchine is a Paris-based tattoo artist renowned for their expertise in fineline and minimalist styles, providing clients with impeccably detailed and delicate designs. Their dedication to professionalism is evident within every element of their work, from intricate linework to ensuring each client's experience is comfortable and exceeds expectations, whether they're at Nine Shop or during their monthly visits to Pallas Studio in Lausanne.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Paris, Ile-de-france, France"
